# `permissions.allow`: a committed one would let a pull request widen the tool
# allowance of the job reviewing it. tests/test_claude_pipeline_trust_boundary.py
# fails if it is ever tracked. See docs/PIPELINE.md § The trust boundary.
.claude/settings.local.json

__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
